{"resource":{"id":"react-practice-questions","title":"React.js \u2014 Practice Questions","category":"Web Development","difficulty":"Beginner","readingTime":"32 min","pages":25,"lastUpdated":"February 2026","tags":["Web Development","React","Hooks"],"heroImage":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1633356122544-f134324a6cee?w=1800&q=80","heroSubtitle":"A structured React.js practice workbook \u2014 350+ exercises spanning MCQs, debugging, JSX, hooks, API integration, routing, component design, output prediction, and mini projects."},"toc":[{"id":"objectives","label":"Learning Objectives"},{"id":"mcq","label":"MCQs (100+)"},{"id":"debug","label":"Debugging Exercises"},{"id":"coding","label":"Coding Challenges"},{"id":"design","label":"Component Design"},{"id":"state","label":"State Management Problems"},{"id":"hooks","label":"Custom Hook Exercises"},{"id":"output","label":"Output Prediction"},{"id":"projects","label":"Mini Projects"},{"id":"summary","label":"Summary"},{"id":"faqs","label":"FAQs"},{"id":"references","label":"References"},{"id":"disclaimer","label":"Disclaimer"}],"related":[{"title":"React.js \u2014 Answer Key","tag":"Web Development","time":"25 min"},{"title":"React.js \u2014 Interview Questions","tag":"Web Development","time":"34 min"},{"title":"React.js \u2014 Complete Tutorial","tag":"Web Development","time":"44 min"}],"html":"<section id=\"objectives\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Learning Objectives</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li>Practice 350+ questions grouped by concept and difficulty.</li>\n          <li>Build reflexes for common React patterns.</li>\n          <li>Ship 5 mini projects from scratch.</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"mcq\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">MCQs (Sample of 100+)</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ol class=\"list-decimal space-y-2 pl-5\">\n          <li>Which of these is NOT a hook? <em>(a) useState (b) useFetch (c) useEffect (d) useRef</em></li>\n          <li>JSX must return: <em>(a) string (b) one root element (c) HTML (d) array</em></li>\n          <li>Keys should be: <em>(a) index (b) random (c) stable unique id (d) any string</em></li>\n          <li>useEffect with empty deps runs: <em>(a) every render (b) once on mount (c) never (d) on unmount</em></li>\n        </ol>\n        <Figure src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1633356122544-f134324a6cee?w=1400&q=80\" caption=\"Figure 1 \u2014 Question distribution: 30% MCQ, 20% debug, 30% code, 20% projects.\" />\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"debug\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Debugging Exercises</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p><strong>Q:</strong> This counter never updates. Why?</p>\n        <div class=\"my-3 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-slate-950 text-slate-100 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/10 px-4 py-2 text-xs text-slate-400\"><span>python</span></div><pre class=\"overflow-x-auto p-4 text-[13px] leading-relaxed\"><code>function C() {\n  let n = 0;\n  return &lt;button onClick={() =&gt; n++}&gt;{n}&lt;/button&gt;;\n}</code></pre></div>\n        <p><em>Hint:</em> React only re-renders when state changes via a setter.</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"coding\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Coding Challenges</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ol class=\"list-decimal space-y-2 pl-5\">\n          <li>Build a stopwatch with start/pause/reset.</li>\n          <li>Implement infinite scroll with IntersectionObserver.</li>\n          <li>Build a modal that traps focus and closes on Escape.</li>\n          <li>Implement a controlled multi-step wizard.</li>\n        </ol>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"design\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Component Design</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Design an accessible Combobox with keyboard navigation, ARIA roles, and async options.</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"state\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">State Management Problems</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Refactor a prop-drilled 5-level tree to use Context. Then extract to Zustand and measure re-renders.</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"hooks\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Custom Hook Exercises</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ol class=\"list-decimal space-y-2 pl-5\">\n          <li><code>useLocalStorage</code></li>\n          <li><code>useDebounce</code></li>\n          <li><code>useOnlineStatus</code></li>\n          <li><code>usePrevious</code></li>\n          <li><code>useMediaQuery</code></li>\n        </ol>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"output\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Output Prediction</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <div class=\"my-3 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-slate-950 text-slate-100 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/10 px-4 py-2 text-xs text-slate-400\"><span>python</span></div><pre class=\"overflow-x-auto p-4 text-[13px] leading-relaxed\"><code>function A() {\n  const [n, setN] = useState(0);\n  useEffect(() =&gt; { setN(n + 1); });\n  return &lt;div&gt;{n}&lt;/div&gt;;\n}\n// What happens?</code></pre></div>\n        <p><em>Answer:</em> Infinite render loop \u2014 effect updates state which triggers another render which re-runs the effect.</p>\n        <Figure src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1555066931-4365d14bab8c?w=1400&q=80\" caption=\"Figure 2 \u2014 Debug flow: read code aloud, trace state, identify trigger, fix root cause.\" />\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"projects\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Mini Projects</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li>Weather app with API.</li>\n          <li>Kanban board with drag & drop.</li>\n          <li>Markdown editor with live preview.</li>\n          <li>Recipe search with pagination.</li>\n          <li>Chat UI with optimistic sends.</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"summary\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Summary &amp; Key Takeaways</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Practice deliberately. After each exercise, refactor once for clarity and once for performance.</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"faqs\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">FAQs</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <details class=\"group my-2 rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-card p-4 open:shadow-sm\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-semibold\"><span>Do the answers live elsewhere?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition group-open:rotate-90\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"/></svg></summary><div class=\"mt-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Yes \u2014 see the React.js Answer Key resource.</div></details>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"references\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Further Reading &amp; References</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\"><References /></div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"disclaimer\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Disclaimer</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Practice workbook \u2014 solutions may vary; multiple correct approaches exist.</p>\n      </div></section>"}